That's why I *never* bless magic markers, sometimes you need cursed or 
uncursed scrolls, just bless the pile of blank scrolls for blessed
cursed:
Genocide
Teleport
Enchant armor
Enchant weapon

uncursed
Enchant armor
Enchant weapon

The reason for enchant armor and weapon is that if the + is greater then +3 
before you enchant it there is a good chance the item will be destroyed.  
And the amout of enchantment is random on blessed +1 on uncursed, and -1 on 
cursed.  So I read blessed til they are +2 to +4, then uncursed or cursed to 
get to +3, then a blessed to get to +4 to +6 (and maybe cursed to get back 
to +3 if I get +4 (or +5 with a good weapon).
Note: +3 armor will only get +1 or +2 from blessed enchantment.
